    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's not even that i want to do anything specific, it's just the idea of the silence. the absolute stillness. i look at my calendar and all i see is more noise, more \"meaningful\" decisions that don't actually mean anything. sometimes i just sit in my car for an hour before going inside because the thought of actually existing for another forty years feels... impossible. like there's no version of this where it gets better, just more of the same.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
